access_replace='dailyPlanBtn.classList.toggle("hidden",profile.role!=="Supervisor");capacityBtn?.classList.toggle("hidden",!["CFO","Supervisor"].includes(profile.role));addExceptionBtn.classList.toggle("hidden",profile.role!=="CFO")'
